(16429,'zhCN','猩猩是很神奇的生物。比夜精灵强多了，不像他们会干出蠢事，譬如...赌钱输个精光，被海狼麦克基雷列为追杀讨债的目标。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(16430,'zhCN','来啊，$r。正好给我的藉口。',NULL,'Warchief Mor\'ghor runs the show here. Don\'t forget it.',NULL,'<The enforcer\'s eyes flash red.>$B$BI hope your pathetic Horde tries to attack us. I am itching to shed some blood, $c!',NULL,'The fury! The power! I have never felt so strong in all my life.$B$BSoon, ALL the Dragonmaw will feel as I do.',NULL,'Don\'t try anything funny, $c.$B$B<The enforcer tenses his fingers near the hilt of his blade, eager for you to make a scene.>',NULL,'Warchief Mor\'ghor will make the Dragonmaw great again!$B$BWe have no need for your pathetic Horde.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
