(16850,'zhCN','千万别低估了後勤管理与补给的重要性。战斗获胜的关键或许在於将士，但战争获胜的关键却在於粮草补给。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(16851,'zhCN','I cannot promise that your rest will be peaceful, $c.  These orcs do not know when to quit.','我无法保证你能够不受干扰地休息，$c。这些兽人不知道何时才会离开。','A drunk orc is  a sight to see.  An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again.','A drunk orc is  a sight to see.  An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again.','If my mother had told me there would be days like this I would not have believed her.','If my mother had told me there would be days like this I would not have believed her.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
