(17745,'zhCN','My apologies, $c, but the arcane secrets of the Highborne will forever remain secrets to you.','我很抱歉，$c，但是精灵贵族们的秘法奥秘对你来说永远会是个秘密。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
