(17747,'zhCN','The magic of today pales in comparison to that of millennia past. Still, we Highborne know much of the arcane. Are you ready to learn?','现代的魔法跟千年前根本无法相比。即使如此，我们精灵贵族仍然知道许多秘法的奥妙。你准备好进行学习了吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17748,'zhCN','Halbin Frosthammer, from the Wildhammer clan, can be found in Thunderbrew Distillery.  He can help teach ya the ways of the shaman.','你可以在雷酒酿酒厂找到蛮锤部族的哈尔宾·霜锤。他可以教导你萨满之道。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
